    },
    {
      "subject": "Alyosha",
      "relation": "QUARRELS_WITH",
      "object": "Ivan",
      "quote": "“But ... that’s absurd!” he cried, flushing. “Your poem is in praise of Jesus, not in blame of Him—as you meant it to be.",
